<title>JAPAN: DKB posts 184.6 bln yen appraisal loss in 96/97.</title>
<headline>DKB posts 184.6 bln yen appraisal loss in 96/97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd said on Wednesday that it posted an appraisal loss of 184.6 billion yen on its securities holdings in the fiscal year which ended on March 31.  </p>
<p>However, the bank said it would not revise its earnings forecast for 1996/97, which was revised most recently on March 7.</p>
</text>
